  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35318001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "这崭新的道具，这闪亮的灯光，这华丽的舞台！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "笨蛋徕卡，你走了什么大运！还不谢谢|101|！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "只是小小的心意而已，上次听你说起选择街头表演的原因。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "就想着如果有一个能安心表演的舞台，你和布鲁特应该都会很开心吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "我很喜欢这份礼物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "请允许我由衷地表示对您的感谢，|101|。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "只是嘴上的感谢也太没有诚意了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "当然！那么接下来有请徕卡和他的伙伴布鲁特——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "是布鲁特和他的伙伴徕卡！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "为|101|带来一场精彩的双人舞表演！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哈哈哈，是徕卡和布鲁特要跳双人舞吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "不不不，我现在诚挚邀请你加入我们，成立一个三人组合！你，愿意吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35318014",
              "text": "愿意。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "35318014",
              "text": "不愿意。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35318013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35318014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "等一下，还是两个人怎么样，我不想带徕卡。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
